    "title": "Indie Remake EXE Beat Battle",
    "description": "This version of horror .EXE is as well as other mods with silly billy in his corupted version is the main opponent.\r\nAs far as fans of Friday night music battles know, nugget looks similar to Son, but with several funk noticeable differences. He transform into his insanity funny version in corruption for unknown reason. Then, in the second half of Too Slow Encore and Red Rings, he is seen floating and is surrounded in electricity, signifying his power.\r\nDo you dare to beat this horror version of Son? Join us to help BF/GF out!\r\n\r\nHOW TO PLAY?\r\n- Make arrows perfectly match.\r\n- Beat all enemies (Impostor V5, Indie cross, Silly Billy, Twiddlefinger), climb to the top rank!\r\n- Feel digital rhythm! Dance with cg5! Rock the beat!\r\n\r\nGAME FEATURE\r\n- Arrows fall follow digital melody\r\n- All mods Full enemies as you expected (Dash spin, Kaine)\r\n- Fantastic background with great sound effects\r\n- Always save your journey while you exit the game\r\n- Be updated frequently!\r\n\r\nHave fun!\r\nFollow us to update new mods as soon as possible via our social media platforms!",
